# Advance Madden NFL 2004 into an on-field coin-toss/play setup scene.
repeat Start 120 60 10 5
repeat A 180 45 12 5
repeat Right 260 90 10 10
repeat A 720 75 14 6
repeat B 760 120 9 6
repeat Right 820 160 7 18
repeat Down 900 180 6 12
repeat Left 1040 220 4 12
repeat A 3200 180 10 5
repeat Start 5000 240 6 5
repeat A 5600 180 12 5
repeat Right 7200 180 4 12
repeat A 8000 180 10 5
repeat Start 9800 240 8 5
repeat A 10800 180 14 5
at 13200 A,Right 900
at 15000 B,Left 600
at 16800 A,Up 900
